    return `${pageHead(ui('候选排名与决策','Candidate ranking & decisions'),ui('WAIT 是保守结论，不是隐藏的买入信号；CANDIDATE 也仅表示通过候选门槛。','WAIT is a conservative conclusion, not a hidden buy signal. CANDIDATE only means the candidate gate passed.'),actions)}<div class='decision-layout'><div>${body}</div><aside class='stack'><div class='wait-principle'><strong>${ui('WAIT｜未形成交易信号','WAIT | No trading signal')}</strong><p>${ui('候选匹配、主币差距、安全门或证据时间任一不足时保持等待。这里不会使用绿色、上涨箭头或“机会”措辞美化 WAIT。','The strategy waits when candidate matching, canonical margin, safety gates, or evidence timing is insufficient. WAIT is never decorated as an opportunity.')}</p></div><div class='safety-box'><h3>${ui('决策边界','Decision boundary')}</h3><p>${ui('控制台只读取策略结果；排名、仓位大小和拒绝原因仍由 memeTrader 的确定性策略计算。','The console only reads strategy results. Ranking, position size, and rejection reasons remain deterministic backend outputs.')}</p><ul><li>${ui('未来 / 陈旧证据不参与决策','future / stale evidence is excluded')}</li><li>${ui('身份 / 推广不能替代主证据','identity / promotion cannot replace feature evidence')}</li><li>${ui('真实交易永久不可在网页开启','live trading can never be enabled here')}</li></ul></div></aside></div>`;
